# The Python images need the workspace manifests, the lock, the service and shared
# packages, the protobuf stubs and the gateway's migrations — nothing else. Everything is
# excluded first, so local files (.env, certs/, logs/, backups/, reports, caches) never
# enter the build context and never invalidate the cached dependency layers.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!apps/physics-engine
!apps/plc-controller
!apps/api-gateway
!apps/historian
!apps/alert-manager
!apps/opcua-server
!shared/observability
!shared/runtime
!shared/generated

**/tests
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
